{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"These "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tokens"}]},{"type":"text","text":" are defined for components and refer to semantic tokens or raw tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They can be seen as a kind of bridge between components and in the end primitive values of the design kit."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misotokenscomponent"]}],"metadata":{"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_design_tokens_components_intro.png"}],"roleHeading":"Library","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"Tokens for components"}],"externalID":"MISOTokensComponent","title":"Tokens for components","symbolKind":"module"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Group","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/AccordionComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/AccordionFaqComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/AlertComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/AlertMessageComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/BarComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/BadgeComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/BulletListComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/ButtonComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/ButtonMonoComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/CategoricalTagComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/CheckboxComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/ChipComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/DividerComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/IconComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/LinkComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/LinkMonoComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/ListItemComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/PinCodeInputComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/ProgressIndicatorComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/QuantityInputComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/RadioButtonComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/SelectInputComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/SkeletonComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/SwitchComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/TagComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/ToastComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/InputTagComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/TextAreaComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/TextInputComponentTokens","doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/TypographyComponentTokens"],"anchor":"Group"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["🧬 Core version: 1.11.0"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Thus if a component need to change for example its "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"background color","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and if a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"component token","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is used for it, then only the value of this "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"token","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" should be changed without any modification on the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"component","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" definition."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Components","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" use "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"component tokens","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" exposed through the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"theme","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" thanks to token providers to get their style values."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components tokens are defined and gathered inside "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift protocol","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" so as to be exposed then through implementation of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" thanks to dedicated tokens providers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because we choose to split responsabilities and objects into their own modules, we faced troubles to make possible for children themes or providers to override properties declared in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"protocols","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and defined in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"extensions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"That is the reason why tokens are exposed as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@objc open"},{"type":"text","text":" to be available and overridable anywhere."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/ButtonComponentTokens","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Declare some component tokens for buttons with properties they must apply","public protocol ButtonComponentTokens {","    var sizeMaxHeightIconOnly: SizeSemanticToken { get }","    var borderWidthDefault: BorderWidthSemanticToken { get }","    var borderRadius: BorderRadiusSemanticToken { get }","    var colorBgDefaultPressedMono: MultipleColorSemanticToken { get }","    var spacePaddingBlock: SpaceSemanticToken { get }","}","","\/\/ There is an existing provider for such tokens","open class BlueCoatThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider { }","","\/\/ Define the components tokens exposed through the theme thanks to provider","extension BlueCoatThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider: ButtonComponentTokens {","","    \/\/ Raw tokens can be used","","    @objc open var sizeMaxHeightIconOnly: SizeSemanticToken { DimensionRawTokens._600 }","    ","    \/\/ And also semantic tokens","","    @objc open var borderWidthDefault: BorderWidthSemanticToken { borders.widthThicker }","    @objc open var borderRadius: BorderRadiusSemanticToken { borders.radiusMedium }","    @objc open var colorBgDefaultPressedMono: MultipleColorSemanticToken { colors.repositoryOpacityBlackHigher }","    @objc open var spacePaddingBlock: SpaceSemanticToken { spaces.paddingInlineSpacious }","}","","\/\/ This provider is then exposed through MISOTheme as an AllButtonComponentTokensProvider"]},{"anchor":"How-to-use-component-tokens","type":"heading","text":"How to use component tokens","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In fact, the component tokens are declared and gathered in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift protocol","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" so as to force any theme to implement them, and also to allow any theme to expose such properties whathever the implementation of the theme is, across providers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"component tokens","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" have for values "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"raw tokens","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"semantic tokens","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and in the end for values primitive types, and all these tokens are declared with "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"type aliases","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" refering all together, you can handle a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"component token","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" directly in your view because the final value will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus, get the theme and call the needed property with some helpers."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct SomeView: View {","","    @Environment(\\.theme) private var theme \/\/ Supposed you used in your root view the `MISOThemeableView` to register the theme","    @Environment(\\.colorScheme) private var colorScheme","","    var body: some View {","        Button {","            \/\/ Some action","        } label: {","            Text(\"Some label\")","                .cornerRadius(theme.button.borderRadius)","        }","        .padding(.leading, theme.button.spacePaddingInlineChevronStartDefault)","        .padding(.trailing, theme.button.spacePaddingInlineChevronEndDefault)","        .background(theme.button.colorBgStrongEnabledMono)","        .overlay(","            RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: theme.button.borderRadius)","                .stroke(Color.blue, lineWidth: theme.button.borderWidthDefault)","        )","    }","\/*","    - The theme provides border semantic tokens \"borderRadius\" and \"borderWidthDefault\"","    - The theme provides a color semantic token \"colorBgStrongEnabledMono\"","    - The theme provides spaces semantic token \"spacePaddingInlineChevronStart\" and \"spacePaddingInlineChevronEnd\"","*\/","}","","\/\/ Do not forget in your app to use the `MISOThemeableView` for your theme, e.g. `BlueCoatTheme`","@main","struct DesignToolbox: App {","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            MISOThemeableView(theme: BlueCoatTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","                ...","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The components tokens are wrapped in tokens provider accessible through the themes:"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Components tokens provider","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Target component","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"accordion \/ accordionFaq","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For accordions components","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"alert","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For alert mesdsages and inline alert components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOAlertMessage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOInlineAlert","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"bar","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For bars components like bottom and navigation bars","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"badge","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For badges like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOBadgeStandard","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOBadgeIcon","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOBadgeCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"button","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For buttons like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOButton","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"bulletList","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For list of elements with bullets like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOBulletList","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"checkbox","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For checkboxes like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOCheckbox","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOCheckboxItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and their indeterminate variants","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"chip","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For chips like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOSuggestionChip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOFilterChip","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"divider","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For dividers like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOHorizontalDivider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOVerticalDivider","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"icon","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For components containing icons like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTag","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"link","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For links like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOLink","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"listItem","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shared and used for switch, checkbox, radio items and list items layouts","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"pinCodeInput","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"quantityInput","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"radioButton","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For radio components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISORadio","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISORadioItem","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"selectInput","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"skeleton","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"switch","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For switch components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOSwitch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOSwitchItem","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"tag","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For tag components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTag","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"inputTag","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For input tag components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOInputTag","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"textArea","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For text area components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTextArea","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"textInput","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For text field input components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTextInput","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"typography","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For textual components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOText","type":"codeVoice"}]}]]],"header":"row"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"references":{"doc://MISOTokensComponent/documentation/MISOTokensComponent/LinkMonoComponentTokens":{"kind":"symbol","title":"LinkMonoComponentTokens","url":"\/documentation\/misotokenscomponent\/linkmonocomponenttokens","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkMonoComponentTokens"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Declares all component tokens for links components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOLink","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"monochrome mode","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Used for tokens providers like ","type":"text"},{"code":"BlueCoatThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkMonoComponentTokens"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/LinkMonoComponentTokens"},"doc://MISOTokensComponent/documentation/MISOTokensComponent/CategoricalTagComponentTokens":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOTokensComponent\/documentation\/MISOTokensComponent\/CategoricalTagComponentTokens","url":"\/documentation\/misotokenscomponent\/categoricaltagcomponenttokens","abstract":[{"text":"Declares all component tokens for categorical tag components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOCategoricalTag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Used for tokens providers like ","type":"text"},{"code":"BlueCoatThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" etc.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CategoricalTagComponentTokens"}],"role":"symbol","title":"CategoricalTagCompone